+---
+"@vitessce/spatial-beta": patch
+---
+
+Only apply the Y-mirror to image layers in the spatialBeta view when synced with Neuroglancer (3D rendering mode with a camera snapshot), fixing misalignment between image and bitmask segmentation layers.
